{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>For all these abominations the men of the land have done.</b> For the nations who did not guard against the occasions of sin and did not punish those who transgressed in forbidden sexual relations committed all the abominations, for from evil to evil they went forth. And so will you too do if you do not keep all these statutes and ordinances of Mine; therefore keep them."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:48.034908121Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}